  unitName: Assassin Oboro
  unitId: 60152
  unitNumber: 219
  description: A ninja said to have lived in the ruined Bariura Empire. After the
    rumors of Oboro died down, a member of the imperial family was assassinated after
    advocating peace and a reduction in war expenditures. Rumors spread that the
    perpetrator was dressed in black, yet somehow Oboro's name never came up. It
    was almost as if someone had tried to erase any evidence that he had any involvement
    in the incident.
  summonDesc: A shinobi's place is in the dark.<br>I don't speak,<br>I just accomplish
    my missions!
  fusionDesc: ......<br>You who gives me power...<br>Whose life are you after?
  evoDesc: Are you trying to lead me<br>further into darkness?<br>Alright, I'll be
    your blade.
  element: 6
  rarity: 2
